{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Amalek came, etc.</b> Since they were negligent in the Torah, which is likened to water and to fire — as it is written (Jeremiah 23:29) ״כֹּה דְבָרִי כָּאֵשׁ״ — and they did not engage in the war of Torah, therefore He punished them with thirst, corresponding to the aspect of water, and with the fire of the war of Amalek."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:29:12.523113636Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}